// names no tenancy, no principal, no host, and never carries a database
// error string — those identify schema and infrastructure (review
// finding 16). Disclosing initialized-or-not is already accepted by
// ADR-0012, and unlike probing `/sys/init` to learn the same thing, this does
// not consume the instance.
